// Meridian's plugin protocol: the wire form of the design plan's §11.4 Emitter
// interface.
//
// The protocol has two services. Emitter carries a compiled resource tree to a
// plugin and carries back the artifact that tree compiles to; it has no side
// effects. Runner hands an artifact to the real tool to preview or apply it,
// and reports what the tool produced. They are separate services on purpose:
// compiling stays a pure function over Emitter alone, and a plugin that only
// compiles never has to mention Runner.
